|spellshield  = True
|spelleffects = spellaoe
|projectile   = True
|notes        = 
* ''Five Point Strike'' will hit enemies after only {{pp|0.25*0.75 to 0.175*0.75 for 4|1;6;11;16|round=3}} seconds (75% of cast time) into the cast time.
** Due to [[tick and updates|any actions only starting on integer game ticks]], the effective cast time rounds up to {{pp|0.264;0.231;0.231;0.198|1;6;11;16|round=3}} and the hit will occur at {{pp|0.198;0.198;0.165;0.132|1;6;11;16|round=3}} seconds into it.
