W.wikitext:
{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Twilight Shroud|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Akali
|skill        = W
|disp_name    = Twilight Shroud
|icon         = Twilight Shroud.png
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Akali''' restores {{sti|{{as|100 energy}}}} over {{fd|0.4}} seconds and gains {{sti|ms|{{as|'''bonus''' movement speed}}}} that decays over 2 seconds. She also detonates a smoke bomb a fixed distance away in the target direction, creating a circular shroud that expands over the next 5 seconds into a ring. The shroud does not permeate terrain, and will expand toward nearby enemy champions. While the shroud is active, '''Akali's''' {{as|'''maximum''' energy}} is increased by {{as|100|energy}}.
|leveling     = {{st|Bonus Movement Speed|{{ap|30 to 50}}%}}
{{st|Shroud Duration|{{ap|5 to 7}} seconds}}
|description2 = Entering the shroud renders '''Akali''' {{tip|invisibility|invisible}}, unless she is {{tip|dash|dashing}}.
|description3 = Declaring a basic attack or casting an ability will break the invisibility and prevent '''Akali''' from entering it again for {{pp|changedisplay=true|round=3|1;0.9;0.825;0.725;0.625|1;7;10;13;16}} seconds, refreshing on subsequent attacks and casts.
|description4 = ''The {{ai|Shuriken Flip|Akali|marked}} section of Twilight Shroud will linger for the mark's duration, even after the shroud ends.''
|description5 = '''''Akali''' can move during Twilight Shroud's cast time.''
|target range = 250
|effect radius= {{dv|{{tt|350|Minimum radius. Estimated.}}|{{tt|1175|Maximum radius. Estimated.}}}}
|speed        = <!--{{tt|X|Expansion speed}}-->
|cooldown     = {{ap|20 to 16}}
|cdstart      = post-effect
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|queue time   = {{fd|0.5}}
|targeting    = Direction
|affects      = Self, Enemies
|notes        = 
* '''Akali''' will also not gain the {{tip|invisibility}} if she is {{si|Recall|Recalling}}.
* It is possible for '''Akali''' to detonate the smoke bomb on the far side of terrain from her current location.
* ''Twilight Shroud's'' effects begin at the start of the cast time.
* Using a basic attack breaks the stealth at the start of the attack windup.
<!-- Blurb -->
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Akali}} restores {{as|{{sti|energy}}}} and gains a brief burst of {{sti|ms|{{as|move speed}}}}. She also drops a smoke shroud that makes her {{tip|invisibility|invisible}}, attacking or using abilities will briefly reveal her.
|blurb2      = The shroud will expand into a ring over a few seconds, during which '''Akali''' gains increased {{as|energy}}.
}}

E.wikitext:
{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Shuriken Flip|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Akali
|skill        = E
|icon         = Shuriken Flip.png
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Akali''' {{tip|dash|flips}} backward after {{fd|0.15}} seconds into the cast time, and after the cast time throws a shuriken in the target direction that deals {{as|magic damage}} to the first enemy hit.
|leveling     = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|70*0.3 to 350*0.3}} {{as|(+ {{ap|100*0.3}}% AD)}} {{as|(+ {{ap|110*0.3}}% AP)}}}}
|description2 = The shuriken ''marks'' and {{tip|true sight|reveals}} the enemy or the last ''{{ai|Twilight Shroud|Akali|smoke}}'' section hit for 3 seconds, during which ''Shuriken Flip'' can be recast to consume the mark.
|icon3        = Shuriken Flip 2.png
|description3 = {{sbc|Recast:}} '''Akali''' {{tip|dash|dashes}} towards the marked target or smoke section. Against enemies she deals {{as|magic damage}} upon arrival.
|leveling3    = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|70*0.7 to 350*0.7}} {{as|(+ {{ap|100*0.7}}% AD)}} {{as|(+ {{ap|110*0.7}}% AP)}}|Total Magic Damage|{{ap|70 to 350}} {{as|(+ 100% AD)}} {{as|(+ 110% AP)}}}}
|description4 = '''''Akali''' will not flip backwards if she is {{tip|immobilized}} or {{tip|grounded}} in the first {{fd|0.15}} seconds of the cast time. {{ai|Twilight Shroud|Akali}} and {{ai|Perfect Execution|Akali}} can be cast during the recast's dash.''
|cooldown     = {{ap|16 to 10}}
|cdstart      = on-cast
|cost         = 30
|costtype     = energy
|target range = {{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|825|Shuriken range, based off of Akali's original location}}
|width        = {{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|120|Shuriken missile width}}
|speed        = {{dv|{{tt|1800|Shuriken missile speed}}|{{tt|1500|First and second dash speed}}}}
|effect radius= {{tt|Global|Recast range}}
|cast time    = {{dv|{{tt|{{fd|0.25}}|Initial cast}}|{{tt|{{fd|0.1}}|Recast}}}}
|queue time   = {{dv|{{tt|{{fd|0.5}}|Initial cast}}|{{tt|{{fd|0.3}}|Recast}}}}
|targeting    = {{dv|[[Direction-targeted|Direction]]|[[Auto-targeted|Auto]]}}
|affects      = Enemies, Self
|damagetype   = magic
|spellshield  = True
|spelleffects = spell
|projectile   = True
|grounded     = True
|knockdown    = True
|notes        = 
* '''Akali''' will track the target if they change locations.
** She will not stop tracking the target until she reaches them, as there is no maximum tracking distance.
* Both casts count as ability activations for the purposes of on-cast effects such as {{tip|Spellblade}} and triggering {{ais|Force Pulse|Kassadin}} passive.
* ''Shuriken Flip'' does not interrupt '''Akali's''' previous move or attack orders.
** The recast does.
* ''Shuriken Flip'' cannot be recast if the target is {{tip|untargetable}} or is in another realm.
* '''Akali''' will be ordered to basic attack the target after the recast's dash ends.
* '''Akali''' will dash backwards up-to 400 units in a straight line. This dash can cross terrain if the end point is beyond it. If she would end the dash inside terrain, she will instead look for a location  in either direction left or right that is outside of terrain and dash there. If there is no such location, she will dash only up to the wall at her normal speed, ending the dash early.
{{Effect at cast time end}}
** The shuriken missile will fire from wherever '''Akali''' is at the end of the cast time (usually mid-dash), but always towards and reaching the location that was 825 units in front of her at the start of cast. The only exception is if she moves via {{si|Flash}}, in which case the range of the missile is decreased relative to the distance she blinked.
* Killing an enemy with the shuriken will still mark the last area of the {{ai|Twilight Shroud|Akali|shroud}} hit.
* Attempting to cast {{ai|Five Point Strike|Akali}} during either dash will buffer it to cast as soon as the dash ends.
* This ability's damage is calculated based on the caster's stats at the time of its application.
{{ct|attack=false|move=false|cast={{ai|Twilight Shroud|Akali}} is usable. {{ai|Shuriken Flip|Akali}} is disabled for 10 seconds and then interrupts. Both dashes of {{ai|Perfect Execution|Akali}} interrupt.|items=true,,,interrupts|spells=true,interrupts,true,true,false}}
<!-- Blurb -->
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Akali}} {{tip|dashes}} backward and throws a shuriken forward that deals {{as|magic damage}} and marks the first enemy or {{ai|Twilight Shroud|Akali|smoke cloud}} hit for a short time.
|blurb2       = While ''Shuriken Flip'' marks a target, it can be recast.
|blurb3       = {{sbc|Recast:}} '''Akali''' {{tip|dashes}} to the marked target across any distance, dealing {{as|magic damage}}.
}}

