R.wikitext:
{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Perfect Execution|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Akali
|skill        = R
|disp_name    = Perfect Execution
|icon         = Perfect Execution.png
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Akali''' {{tip|dash|dashes}} 750 units in the direction of the target enemy {{tip|champion}}, dealing {{as|magic damage}} to enemies she passes through. If this hits an enemy, she flips over them to continue the dash up to the normal range but for at least another 150 units.
|leveling     = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|110 to 330}} {{as|(+ 50% '''bonus''' AD)}} {{as|(+ 30% AP)}}}}
|description2 = ''Perfect Execution'' can be recast after a {{fd|2.5}}-second {{tt|static cooldown|Unaffected by ability haste}} within 10 seconds of the first activation.
|icon3        = Perfect Execution 2.png
|description3 = {{sbc|Recast:}} '''Akali''' {{tip|dash|dashes}} {{tt|800|Estimated}} units in the target direction, dealing {{as|magic damage}} to enemies she passes through, increased by {{as|{{pp|key=%|key1=%|type=target's '''missing''' health|0 to 200 for 11|0 to 70|formula=2.86% per 1% of target's '''missing''' health, capped at 70% '''missing''' health}}|health}}.
|leveling3    = {{st|Minimum Magic Damage|{{ap|70 to 210}} {{as|(+ 30% AP)}}|Maximum Magic Damage|{{ap|70*3 to 210*3}} {{as|(+ {{ap|30*3}}% AP)}}}}
|target range = {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|675|First cast range}}
|speed        = {{dv|{{tt|1500|Initial dash speed}}|{{tt|3000|Second dash speed}}}}
|collision radius= {{tip|er|icononly = true}} {{tt|110|Both casts dash collision, estimated}}
|cooldown     = {{ap|120 to 60}}
|cdstart      = post-effect
|cast time    = {{dv|{{tt|{{fd|0.25}}|Initial cast}}|{{tt|None|Recast}}}}
|queue time   = {{dv|{{tt|{{fd|0.5}}|Initial cast}}|{{tt|{{fd|0.3}}|Recast}}}}
|targeting    = {{dv|[[Unit-targeted|Unit]]|[[Direction-targeted|Direction]]}}
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Magic
|spellshield  = True
|spelleffects = spellaoe
|grounded     = True
|knockdown    = True
|terraingrace = true
|outofrange   = Walk in range of the target unit to cast (first cast)
|notes        = 
*Both casts count as ability activations for the purposes of on-cast effects such as {{tip|Spellblade}} and triggering {{ais|Force Pulse|Kassadin}} passive.
* With the first cast, '''Akali''' can dash up to a maximum of 900 units if the first enemy she hit was at the maximum dash range.
* Casting {{si|Flash}} during either dashes will interrupt them, but '''Akali''' will deal damage to any enemies she comes in contact with at the new location.
** Enemies already hit by either of ''Perfect Execution's'' casts cannot be affected more than once by the same cast.
* {{ai|Shuriken Flip|Akali}} can be used during the initial dash if it is cast after ''Perfect Execution's'' cast time finishes.
* This ability's damage is calculated based on the caster's stats at the start of cast and does not change dynamically.
<!-- Blurb -->
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Akali}} {{tip|dashes}} in the direction of the target enemy champion, dealing {{as|physical damage}} to enemies she passes through.
|blurb2       = ''Perfect Execution'' can be recast within a period.
|blurb3       = {{sbc|Recast:}} '''Akali''' {{tip|dashes}} in the target direction, dealing {{as|magic damage}} to enemies she passes through based on {{as|their '''missing''' health}}.
}}

